# Add to ~/.claude/.gitignore ONLY if you sync ~/.claude through a private git repo.
# The ledger, event log and watcher state are per-machine and must never leave the machine.
state/
# supervisors/<profile>.md IS tracked: it is each machine's published ledger summary, which
# lets the other machines (and the hypervisor) read where its work stands. Its temp files are not.
supervisors/*.tmp
